{"id":"85f2090b97d3acf6","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable.md","title":"ZFC Multiplicatively Indecomposable","display":"df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable — ZFC Multiplicatively Indecomposable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable","aliases":["58-df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable"],"display":"df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable — ZFC Multiplicatively Indecomposable","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-ordmul]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-multiplicatively-indecomposable — ZFC Multiplicatively Indecomposable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e510d30d624c8a51\" href=\"?note=e510d30d624c8a51\" title=\"58-df-ordmul\">58-df-ordmul</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\)</span> (ordinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdMul}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdMul}\\)</span> (ordinal-multiplication class operation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e510d30d624c8a51\" href=\"?note=e510d30d624c8a51\" title=\"58-df-ordmul\">58-df-ordmul</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiplicativelyIndecomposable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiplicativelyIndecomposable}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}multiplicatively\\text{-}indecomposable} \\vdash \\mathrm{MultiplicativelyIndecomposable}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land 1\\in\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{OrdMul}(\\beta,\\gamma)\\in\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}multiplicatively\\text{-}indecomposable} \\vdash \\mathrm{MultiplicativelyIndecomposable}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land 1\\in\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{OrdMul}(\\beta,\\gamma)\\in\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiplication is the sourced ordinal operation, not cardinal or ring multiplication.  The guard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\in\\alpha\">\\(1\\in\\alpha\\)</span> excludes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"